{'symbol': 'NOC', 'date': '2023-01-11 11:30:00', 'title': 'NORTHROP GRUMMAN DEVELOPING THE NEXT GENERATION RADAR FOR THE F-35 LIGHTNING II', 'text': "BALTIMORE, JAN. 11, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- NORTHROP GRUMMAN CORPORATION (NYSE: NOC) IS DEVELOPING AN/APG-85, AN ADVANCED ACTIVE ELECTRONICALLY SCANNED ARRAY (AESA) RADAR FOR THE F-35 LIGHTNING II. NORTHROP GRUMMAN CURRENTLY MANUFACTURES THE AN/APG-81 ACTIVE ELECTRONICALLY SCANNED ARRAY (AESA) FIRE CONTROL RADAR, THE CORNERSTONE TO THE F-35 LIGHTNING II'S SENSOR SUITE."}